  "name": "Semantic Traversal",
  "description": "Semantic Traversal is a local-first semantic context compiler and auditable retrieval runtime for conversations over structured Markdown corpora. It separates semantic planning, runtime-owned lexical, vector, graph, and temporal retrieval, provenance and coverage auditing, and bounded frontier-model synthesis.",
